ADDITIONAL NOTICE / 附加声明

This software is a medication reminder and record-keeping aid. It is NOT a
medical device and does NOT provide medical advice. Reminder delivery depends
on the host operating system's alarm and notification mechanisms and is not
guaranteed. Do not rely on this software as the sole safeguard for medication
adherence. Always follow the instructions of your physician and the medication
package insert.

本软件是服药提醒与记录的辅助工具，不是医疗器械，不提供医疗建议。提醒的送达依赖
手机操作系统的闹钟与通知机制，无法保证必达，请勿将其作为唯一的用药保障手段。
用药方案请遵医嘱并以药品说明书为准。
